OL,3,APolice investigate unknown substance
OL,4,Athat caused arena evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people were evacuated from
OL,7,Fa concert in Manchester after an
OL,8,F"unknown substance" was released into
OL,9,Fthe crowd.
OL,11,FIt happened towards the end of US
OL,12,Frapper Don Toliver's show at the Co-op
OL,13,FLive arena at about 22:00 GMT on
OL,14,FSunday, with music fans describing a
OL,15,F"horrible smell" and people
OL,16,F"screaming".
OL,18,FOne person was taken to hospital while
OL,19,Fmore than 50 people were assessed for
OL,20,F"eye and respiratory symptoms", the
OL,21,FNorth West Ambulance Service said.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
